@startuml
title OmniTrade AI - UML communication diagram for one analysis
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
object ":NewAnalysisUI" as UI
object ":RunAPI" as API
object ":WorkflowValidator" as Validator
object ":ReadinessScheduler" as Scheduler
object ":EvidenceGateway" as Evidence
object ":SpecialistPool" as Specialists
object ":ResearchCoordinator" as Research
object ":RiskCoordinator" as Risk
object ":ReportBuilder" as Report
object ":Repository/EventLog" as Repo
UI --> API : 1: createRun(configuration)
API --> Validator : 1.1: validate(version, configuration)
Validator --> Repo : 1.2: save immutable run snapshot
API --> Scheduler : 2: execute(run)
Scheduler --> Evidence : 2.1*: collect selected evidence roles
Evidence --> Repo : 2.2*: save normalized evidence/events
Scheduler --> Specialists : 3*: execute selected specialists
Specialists --> Research : 4: join typed reports
Research --> Risk : 5: proposal + bull/bear cases
Risk --> Report : 6: validated decision + role outputs
Report --> Repo : 6.1: save report/lineage/artifact hashes
Repo --> UI : 7*: stream events and expose report
note bottom
Numbers show message order; * marks repeated or parallel messages.
end note
@enduml
